  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responsive, Accountable Governance and Peacebuilding Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Initiation Plan (PIP) will set the foundation for the RAGP Project with the goal to 1) improve access to justice, 2) support government&#x2019;s peace building and Security Sector Reforms (SSR) initiatives, 3) strengthen transitional justiceprocesses, 4) strengthen governance institutions at the national and local levels, for socio-economic opportunity and inclusive service delivery, and 5) enhance the capacities of women, youth, and people with disabilities in governance.</narrative>
  </description>
